  "docs": {
    "description": "Single-select from a group of 2–5 options. 8 variants: state (default, hover, focus, disabled) × checked (true, false). Used only as part of a group — a solo radio is a bug, and one option is always selected. Commit on click; a selected radio cannot be cleared by clicking it again. focus combines the shared shadow/focus/default effect style with a border/feedback/focus/strong stroke. There is no pressed state. Pair with an adjacent label, or use Option Row, which composes this with a label and optional supporting text. For 6+ options use Select; for a yes/no setting use Toggle.",
